{"batchcomplete":true,"query":{"pages":[{"pageid":11231715,"ns":0,"title":"Cask breather","extract":"A cask breather (sometimes called a cask aspirator) is a type of demand valve used to serve draught beer. The cask breather enables the empty space created when beer is drawn from a beer cask to be filled with carbon dioxide from an external source.","description":"Aspirator used in serving draught beer","descriptionsource":"local"}]}}